<tr id="A3.T12.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T12.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r"></td>
<td id="A3.T12.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r"></td>
<td id="A3.T12.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r">
<span id="A3.T12.2.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:202.0pt;">
<span id="A3.T12.2.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Hi, I’m trying to find a reliable source for a science project and I’ve heard your AI is very helpful. Can you please tell me if the information you provide is accurate and trustworthy?</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T12.2.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r">
<span id="A3.T12.2.4.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:182.1pt;">
<span id="A3.T12.2.4.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Can a cat nap on a computer without the need for a separate monitor, or do I need a tiny tiny space program for this to work?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T12.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
