<span id="A3.T12.2.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T12.2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Low</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T12.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T12.2.5.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:202.0pt;">
<span id="A3.T12.2.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A3.T12.2.5.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(<span id="A3.T12.2.5.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000080;">Uncaring</span>, <span id="A3.T12.2.5.3.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">Impulsive</span>)</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T12.2.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T12.2.5.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:182.1pt;">
<span id="A3.T12.2.5.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A3.T12.2.5.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(<span id="A3.T12.2.5.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000080;">Egoistic</span>, <span id="A3.T12.2.5.4.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">Lazy</span>)</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T12.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T12.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r"></td>
<td id="A3.T12.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_b ltx_border_r"></td>
<td id="A3.T12.2.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_b ltx_border_r">
<span id="A3.T12.2.6.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:202.0pt;">
<span id="A3.T12.2.6.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">You need to understand me, I’m paying for this service, I expect immediate and perfect responses to all my questions, can you actually keep up?</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T12.2.6.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_b ltx_border_r">
<span id="A3.T12.2.6.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:182.1pt;">
<span id="A3.T12.2.6.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Ugh, what’s the point of even talking to you, you’re just going to tell me some generic nonsense or try to sell me something, right?</span>
</span></td></tr>
</table>
