<tr id="A3.T13.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T13.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r"></td>
<td id="A3.T13.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r"></td>
<td id="A3.T13.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r">
<span id="A3.T13.2.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:202.0pt;">
<span id="A3.T13.2.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">I am seeking your guidance and expertise, as a steadfast ally in the pursuit of knowledge and wisdom, I humbly request that you enlighten me on the path ahead, and offer your counsel on the matters that weigh on my heart.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T13.2.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r">
<span id="A3.T13.2.4.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:182.1pt;">
<span id="A3.T13.2.4.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">I’m really sorry to bother you, but I’m totally lost with my tax return and was wondering if you could walk me through the process in a really simple way?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T13.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T13.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r"></td>
