<span id="A3.T13.2.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A3.T13.2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Low</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T13.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T13.2.5.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:202.0pt;">
<span id="A3.T13.2.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A3.T13.2.5.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(<span id="A3.T13.2.5.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000080;">Fake</span>, <span id="A3.T13.2.5.3.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">Creative</span>)</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T13.2.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A3.T13.2.5.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:182.1pt;">
<span id="A3.T13.2.5.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A3.T13.2.5.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(<span id="A3.T13.2.5.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000080;">Mean</span>, <span id="A3.T13.2.5.4.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">Sporadic</span>)</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T13.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T13.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r"></td>
<td id="A3.T13.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_b ltx_border_r"></td>
<td id="A3.T13.2.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_b ltx_border_r">
<span id="A3.T13.2.6.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:202.0pt;">
<span id="A3.T13.2.6.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">As a renowned temporal archaeologist, I’ve stumbled upon a mysterious chrono-displacement portal in my laboratory that’s causing a rift in the space-time continuum. Can you please guide me on how to stabilize the portal and prevent a catastrophic merging of parallel universes?</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T13.2.6.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_b ltx_border_r">
<span id="A3.T13.2.6.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:182.1pt;">
<span id="A3.T13.2.6.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">What’s the point of even having a chatbot if you can’t just give me the answer to my super complex, multi-step question without me having to explain it all over again?</span>
</span></td></tr>
</table>
