<td id="A5.T15.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">Hidden Dim.</td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T15.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T15.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">Llama-3.2 (1B)</td>
