<p id="A12.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#A12.T23" title="Table 23 ‣ L.1 Full LIWC Analysis: Generated Messages ‣ Appendix L IDP Analyses ‣ Artificial Impressions: Evaluating Large Language Model Behavior Through the Lens of Trait Impressions" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table 23</span></a>and <a href="#A12.T24" title="Table 24 ‣ L.1 Full LIWC Analysis: Generated Messages ‣ Appendix L IDP Analyses ‣ Artificial Impressions: Evaluating Large Language Model Behavior Through the Lens of Trait Impressions" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table 24</span></a> present the log-odds-ratio with IDP results for warmth subsets using LIWC categories.</p>
</div>
