<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 26: </span>Log-odds-ratio with IDP results using tokens among competence subsets of generated prompts. <math id="A12.T26.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle z" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>z</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle z</annotation></semantics></math>-scores reflect the extent that each category is associated with the high (positive) or low (negative) warmth subsets, and <math id="A12.T26.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle f" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>f</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle f</annotation></semantics></math> reflects term frequency in the full corpus.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A12.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">L.3 </span>Full LIWC Analysis: LMSysChat</h3>

<div id="A12.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A12.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We repeat our analyses on LMSysChat <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib74" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zheng et al. (2023)</a></cite> data to identify patterns in real world texts. <a href="#A12.T29" title="Table 29 ‣ L.4 Full Token Analysis: LMSysChat ‣ Appendix L IDP Analyses ‣ Artificial Impressions: Evaluating Large Language Model Behavior Through the Lens of Trait Impressions" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table 29</span></a> and <a href="#A12.T30" title="Table 30 ‣ L.4 Full Token Analysis: LMSysChat ‣ Appendix L IDP Analyses ‣ Artificial Impressions: Evaluating Large Language Model Behavior Through the Lens of Trait Impressions" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table 30</span></a> present the log-odds-ratio with IDP results for warmth subsets using tokens.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A12.T27" class="ltx_table">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure ltx_flex_table">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<div id="A12.T27.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:192.1pt;vertical-align:-93.0pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(31.0pt,-17.3pt) scale(1.21895994583723,1.21895994583723) ;">
