<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 28: </span>Log-odds-ratio with IDP results using LIWC categories among competence subsets of LMSysChat prompts. <math id="A12.T28.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle z" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>z</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle z</annotation></semantics></math>-scores reflect the extent that each category is associated with the high (positive) or low (negative) warmth subsets, and <math id="A12.T28.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle f" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>f</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle f</annotation></semantics></math> reflects category frequency in the full corpus.</figcaption>
